ilic provides CMake package targets:

    find_package(ilic CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(your_target PRIVATE ilic::core)

For the C API use:

    find_package(ilic CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(your_target PRIVATE ilic::capi)

The overlay port is deliberately library-only. It does not build the
command-line tools or native INTERLIS repository support.
